OL,3,GNEWSA'We bring traditional Manx music
OL,4,Ato life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor 20 years, youth club Bree has been
OL,7,Fbringing young people together on the
OL,8,FIsle of Man "so they meet each other
OL,9,Fand start making new friendships and
OL,10,Fnew bands", says founder Dr Chloe
OL,11,FWoolley.
OL,13,FThe Manx music and dance group, whose
OL,14,Fname means "vitality", was set up to
OL,15,Fgive children who had never come across
OL,16,Ftraditional music "a fun introduction"
OL,17,Fto it.
OL,19,FSince then, its young musicians have
OL,20,Fgone on to play festivals, record
OL,21,Falbums, perform at the Royal Albert
OL,22,FHall and build professional careers.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
